msgid "Contributing {#contributing}"
msgstr "Mitwirken {#contributing}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The source code is available [on GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation).\n"
msgstr "Der Quellcode ist [auf GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation) verfügbar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The developer guide is located at [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) in the root of this project’s repository. By participating, you are expected to uphold Qiskit’s [code of conduct](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).\n"
msgstr "Der Entwicklerleitfaden befindet sich in [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) im Stammverzeichnis des Repositorys dieses Projekts. Mit deiner Teilnahme erklärst du dich bereit, den [Verhaltenskodex](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md) von Qiskit einzuhalten.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We use [GitHub issues](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/issues/new/choose) for tracking requests and bugs.\n"
msgstr "Wir verwenden [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/issues/new/choose), um Anfragen und Fehler zu verfolgen.\n"

